nd \"pnpm test --filter core\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:01:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:02:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"Edit","callId":"call-42"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:03:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","tool":"Edit","ok":true,"callId":"call-42"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:04:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"Lina Park (lina@acme.dev)\" ts=\"1001.000144\">\n迁移演练的完整记录：\n\n1. `pg_dump --format=directory -j 8` 导出 412 GB，用时 38 分钟；\n2. 新实例 Postgres 17，`pg_restore -j 16`，用时 1 小时 12 分钟；\n3. 逻辑复制追平增量，延迟稳定在 200 ms 以内；\n4. 切换：停写 → 等复制追平 → 改连接串 → 恢复写，**停写 3 分 41 秒**；\n5. 校验：每张表行数一致，抽样 10 万行逐列比对无差异。\n\n发现的问题：\n\n- `orders` 上有一个函数索引用了 `to_char`，17 里被标成了不安全，需要改成 immutable 的包装函数；\n- 连接池 pgbouncer 1.21 和 17 的 SCRAM 有兼容问题，升到 1.23 解决。\n\n正式迁移建议放在周六上午，预计停写 4 分钟以内。需要你确认时间，我来发公告。\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:05:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:06:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Read","callId":"call-46"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:07:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"自建 runner 上缓存命中率现在 87%，平均 CI 时间从 14 分钟降到 6 分 40 秒。还有 arm64 的 Android 构建没迁，等新机器到。","tool":"Read","ok":true,"callId":"call-46"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:08:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"左子健 (me@x.com)\" ts=\"1001.000148\">\n合吧\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:09:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:10:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"Bash",