" ts=\"1001.000180\">\n这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:41:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:42:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"Edit","callId":"call-82"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:43:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","tool":"Edit","ok":true,"callId":"call-82"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:44:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"Lina Park (lina@acme.dev)\" ts=\"1001.000184\">\n## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏）时整表失效一次，而不是逐行；\n3. 头像图片解码挪到后台线程，主线程只拿结果。\n\n```kotlin\nval height = heights.getOrPut(row.id to width) { measure(row, width) }\n```\n\n### 结果\n\n| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |\n\n录屏和 trace 在附件里。还有一个问题需要你决定：低端机上要不要把头像的圆角改成预先裁好的位图？能再省 1.5 ms/帧，但内存多 4 MB。\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:45:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:46:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Read","callId":"call-86"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:47:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"Heap snapshots show the growth is the markdown cache: entries are never evicted for archived chats. Capped it at 500 and added an LRU; RSS is flat over 6 hours ","tool":"Read","ok":true,"callId":"call-86"},{"at":"2026-10-06T07:48:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>bg-88</task-id>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Background command \"pnpm test --filter core\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>"},{"at":"2026-1