aused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:01:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:02:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Edit","callId":"call-102"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:03:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"在看了，大概 20 分钟。","tool":"Edit","ok":true,"callId":"call-102"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:04:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>bg-104</task-id>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Background command \"pnpm test --filter core\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:05:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:06:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"Read","callId":"call-106"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:07:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","tool":"Read","ok":true,"callId":"call-106"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:08:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"Lina Park (lina@acme.dev)\" ts=\"1001.000208\">\n合吧\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:09:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:10:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Bash","callId":"call-110"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:11:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"Effect 4.0 的升级跑完了：类型错误 112 处都改了，测试 2,431 个全部通过。有两处 Stream API 的语义变了，我写在 PR 描述里，需要你看一下是否接受。","tool":"Bash","ok":true,"callId":"call-110"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:12:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"左子健 (me@x.com)\" ts=\"1001.000212\">\nDone: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.\n\n闪烁是因为第一帧拿不到缓存的列表，骨架和真实内容之间切了一次。改成先读设备上的缓存再决定画什么，录屏里已经看不到闪了。\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:13:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:14:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"mcp__stillfail__chat_post","callId":"call-114"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:15:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","tool":"mcp__stillfail__chat_post","ok":true,"callId":"call-114"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:16:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"Lina Park (lina@acme.dev)\" ts=\"1001.000216\">\n这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:17:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:18:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Grep","callId":"call-118"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:19:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"自建 runner 上缓存命中率现在 87%，平均 CI 时间从 14 分钟降到 6 分 40 秒。还有 arm64 的 Android 构建没迁，等新机器到。","tool":"Grep","ok":true,"callId":"call-118"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:20:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>bg-120</task-id>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Background command \"pnpm test --filter core\" completed (exit code 0)</summary>\n</task-notification>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:21:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:22:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"Edit","callId":"call-122"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:23:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","tool":"Edit","ok":true,"callId":"call-122"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:24:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"Lina Park (lina@acme.dev)\" ts=\"1001.000224\">\nHere's what I found in the station worker's memory growth:\n\n- RSS grows ~38 MB/hour with 6 chats open, and never comes back down;\n- heap snapshots at 0 h, 2 h and 6 h show `MdCache` holding 41k entries at the end, 93% of them for archived chats;\n- nothing evicts them: `forget()` is only called when a chat is deleted, never when it is archived.\n\nThe fix (PR #5251):\n\n```ts\nconst cache = new Lru<string, Md>(500, (key) => kept.delete(key));\ndata.onArchived((station, key) => cache.dropWhere((k) => k.startsWith(`${station}\\u0001${key}`)));\n```\n\nAfter it, RSS is flat at 212 MB over 6 hours with the same load. I also added a test that archives 1,000 chats and checks the cache stays at 500.\n\nOne question: should the cap be per workspace or for the whole device? Per device is simpler, but a big workspace could push a small one's chats out.\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:25:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:26:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Read","callId":"call-126"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:27:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"日志轮转改成按天切了，保留 14 天，旧的压缩成 .gz。重启 station 之后看了一下 ~/.stillfail/logs，文件名是 station-2026-11-10.log，没问题。","tool":"Read","ok":true,"callId":"call-126"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:28:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"左子健 (me@x.com)\" ts=\"1001.000228\">\n这里的 timeout 我改成了按 Clock 的 sleep，测试里用 TestClock 推进，不再有真实等待。顺便删掉了两个只为了等时间的 retry。\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:29:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:30:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"Bash","callId":"call-130"},