text":"这个方向可以，但请先别动 data.ts 的 schema，改了要写迁移，我们下周统一做。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:42:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Edit","callId":"call-142"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:43:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"需要人工确认：生产库迁移要停写大约 4 分钟，什么时候可以做？我建议周六上午 9 点。","tool":"Edit","ok":true,"callId":"call-142"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:44:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"左子健 (me@x.com)\" ts=\"1001.000244\">\n## 结论\n\n列表掉帧的根因是**每一帧都在重新测量行高**：`measure_row` 在滚动时被调用了 1,800 次/秒。\n\n### 做了什么\n\n1. 行高在第一次布局时算好并缓存，键是行的 id 和宽度；\n2. 宽度变化（旋转、分屏）时整表失效一次，而不是逐行；\n3. 头像图片解码挪到后台线程，主线程只拿结果。\n\n```kotlin\nval height = heights.getOrPut(row.id to width) { measure(row, width) }\n```\n\n### 结果\n\n| 设备 | 之前掉帧 | 之后 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Pixel 8 | 23.1% | 0.6% |\n| Galaxy S24 | 17.4% | 0.9% |\n| Redmi Note 13 | 41.0% | 3.2% |\n\n录屏和 trace 在附件里。还有一个问题需要你决定：低端机上要不要把头像的圆角改成预先裁好的位图？能再省 1.5 ms/帧，但内存多 4 MB。\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:45:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"Could you check whether the beta channel is on for your phone? The fix shipped in 0.1.7018 and your logs say 0.1.7012."},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:46:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"pnpm exec tsgo --noEmit && node --test test/views.test.ts","tool":"Read","callId":"call-146"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:47:00.000Z","kind":"tool_result","text":"✔ 311 tests passed (14.2s)","tool":"Read","ok":true,"callId":"call-146"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:48:00.000Z","kind":"user","text":"<message via=\"web\" connect=\"ember\" thread=\"EMBER/1001.0\" from=\"Lina Park (lina@acme.dev)\" ts=\"1001.000248\">\nDone: the migration ran on staging in 3 min 41 s with writes paused; no errors, row counts match. Production is ready when you are.\n</message>"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:49:00.000Z","kind":"thinking","text":"PR 已经开了：https://github.com/acme/app/pull/5244 ，CI 在跑，大概 12 分钟。"},{"at":"2026-10-06T08:50:00.000Z","kind":"tool_call","text":"src/views/views.ts","tool":"Bash","callId":"ca